<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Sends controller-global, fully templated Slack notifications on build start and
  completion via an Incoming Webhook, gated by an opt-in job-name allowlist — with no
  Jenkinsfile changes. Messages use token-macro templates plus built-in
  <code>SLACK_*</code> macros; dispatch is asynchronous and best-effort, so Slack
  latency never blocks a build.
</div>
